				</connector>
				<text_box uid="119" x="119.13" y="819.98" width="526.667" height="93.8333">Energy demand change with temperature change has differing total effects in the literature.
Clarke et al (on the left) estimate and over all increase in Energy Demand while Rode et al. estimate a reduction in over all demand.

This affects the energy use per CCD, energy use per HDD variables. Any change in the energy demand for heating cooling requires a recalibration of per person use of energy.</text_box>
				<aux font_style="italic" font_weight="bold" x="1055.12" y="917.798" name="Switch to energy prices"/>
				<connector uid="123" angle="222.245">
					<from>Switch_to_energy_prices</from>
					<to>effect_of_energy_prices_on_electrification_share_for_Buildings</to>
				</connector>
