				<text_box uid="146" x="1466.97" y="560.8" width="260" height="58">This structure translates non electricity demand into demand per energy carrier. It allocates the overall energy into coal, oil, gas</text_box>
				<aux font_style="italic" font_weight="bold" label_side="top" x="794.413" y="887.461" name="UNIT TWh to MWh"/>
