				<text_box uid="135" x="466.25" y="1637.9" width="260" height="58">This is a PID controler
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proportional%E2%80%93integral%E2%80%93derivative_controller</text_box>
				<text_box uid="136" x="466.25" y="1595.7" width="260" height="29.6667">PID factors. Negative values dampen deviations, positive values amplify</text_box>
				<text_box uid="137" x="303.357" y="1526.15" width="131.667" height="15">Proportional control</text_box>
				<text_box uid="138" x="495.328" y="1533.08" width="145.928" height="16.875">differentiating control, smoothes </text_box>
				<text_box uid="139" x="765.537" y="1533.02" width="145.928" height="58.6666">integrating control, responds to continuing deviations</text_box>
