				<text_box uid="4" x="500.089" y="999.177" width="260" height="58">This is a PID controler
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proportional%E2%80%93integral%E2%80%93derivative_controller</text_box>
				<text_box uid="5" x="500.089" y="956.977" width="260" height="29.6667">PID factors. Negative values dampen deviations, positive values amplify</text_box>
