previous_effect_of_STA_on_hydropower_energy_capacity_efficiency
ELSE
1+ (effect_of_STA_on_hydropower_energy_capacity_efficiency_slope[selected_energy_supply_hydroelectric_damages_case]*Surface_Temperature_Anomaly+effect_of_STA_on_hydropower_energy_capacity_efficiency_quadratic[selected_energy_supply_hydroelectric_damages_case]*Surface_Temperature_Anomaly^2)/100</eqn>
